DESCRIPTION:Are you ready for the ultimate grilling experience? A celebrat
 ion of the BIG GREEN EGG® Grill! Mark Your Calendars! Join us for a sizzl
 ing day of fiery competition at our 3rd Annual Klem's BIG GREEN EGG® Fest
  on Saturday October 10th from 12pm-4pm. A day to celebrate mouthwatering 
 BBQ on the ultimate All-In-One Grill! Whether you are a seasoned Egghead o
 r just love great backyard BBQ\, this is the event for you. Gather your fr
 iends and treat yourself to all-you-can eat deliciousness\, live grilling 
 demos\, and festival FUN! Watch an incredible BBQ Cook-off featuring the b
 est pitmasters around\, tasty food samples\, special deals\, raffles\, and
  lots more. Not to mention some of your favorite local businesses joining 
 in the mix\, Hardwick Winery and Altruist Brewing will be serving up some 
 of their favorite drinks! Plus\, DJ Brian will be keeping the energy going
  all day long with great music and festival vibes! Try out Backwoods Bagge
 rs Cornhole! Bring your appetite and your love for all things grilled - th
 is is a family-friendly event you won't want to miss! Of course\, we didn
 ’t forget about our aspiring chefs either! Don’t forget to bring your 
 Mini Chef in the making to compete in our Kid’s Egg Fest Competition! Em
 ail lizf@klemsonline.com to sign-up. TICKETS ARE ON SALE NOW! Click here t
 o grab yours! https://www.eventbrite.com/.../klems-eggfest-2026-tickets...
  COME JOIN US AS A COOK TEAM! Want to show off your teams BBQ skills and c
 ompete for the ultimate EGG prize? Click here for all the FAQS! https://m.
 cmpgn.page/nFhmBN Register you and your BBQ buddies and face off against c
 ooks from all over New England! We can’t wait to taste what you come up 
 with! https://m.cmpgn.page/tnqSG6 Demo Eggs are available to purchase! Onc
 e you taste the amazing BBQ that the Big Green Egg® produces you will wan
 t your very own\, and why not grab one at a DISCOUNT? You will have the op
 tion of purchasing one of the Eggs used by our competing chefs at a specia
 l discounted price! Not only that but get two FREE tickets to our 3rd Annu
 al 𝑲𝒍𝒆𝒎'𝒔 EggFest! Call us today to reserve yours! 508-885-
 2708 Let's fire it up! Sources: Discover Central Massachusetts Event page:
  https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/klems-3rd-annual-egg-fest!/30324/
 \n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery:
  Local fallback from massachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.di
 scovercentralma.org/event/klems-3rd-annual-egg-fest!/30324/
LOCATION:Klem's\, 117 W. Main St.\, Spencer\, MA\, 01562
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/klems-3rd-annual-egg-fest!/303
