BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Half-Earth Day: Half-Earth at 10: Honoring A Legacy of Hope
DTSTART:20261012T000000
DTEND:20261012T000000
DTSTAMP:20261010T163808Z
UID:797518dcb2ff328d32fa8a56aec821@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Join scientists\, artists\, and Indigenous leaders to explore 
 how courage\, imagination\, and wisdom pass from one generation to the nex
 t — on the tenth anniversary of E.O. Wilson's Half-Earth. The day moves 
 between science\, art\, and testimony: wild places brought to life through
  film and photography\, Indigenous voices renewing our relationship to lan
 d\, a tribute to E.O. Wilson through the people who knew him best\, poetry
  and music that carry what data alone cannot. Scholar\, writer\, and artis
 t Adrienne Keene (Cherokee Nation) guides guests through it all as emcee. 
 The program includes a land acknowledgment and performances by Larry Spott
 ed Crow Mann (Hassanamisco Nipmuc Nation) · live photography and film by 
 Florian Schulz · a tribute to E.O. Wilson in his own words · a session o
 n the resilience of New England's forests with Sherri Mitchell (Penobscot 
 Nation) and the Harvard Forest · a keynote on the Endangered Species Act 
 with a performance by Julian NoiseCat · and the presentation of the E.O. 
 Wilson Legacy Award for Transformative Conservation Leadership to the Goro
 ngosa Restoration Project. LEARN MORE / GET TICKETS Sources: Meet Boston E
 vent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/half-earth-day%3a-half-earth-a
 t-10%3a-honoring-a-legacy-of-hope/93389/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 mile
 s of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachusetts
 -events.ics\nSource page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/half-earth-day%
 3a-half-earth-at-10%3a-honoring-a-legacy-of-hope/93389/
LOCATION:Sanders Theatre\, Harvard University\, Sanders Theatre\, Harvard 
 University 45 Quincy St.\, Cambridge\, MA\, 02138
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/half-earth-day%3a-half-earth-at-10%3a
 -honoring-a-legacy-of-hope/93389/
END:VEVENT
