UID:4f5c63e30c8e6939f2f8dcf36f5665@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Join the Indigenous Peoples Celebration Committee and the Offi
 ce of Diversity\, Equity\, Inclusion and Community Relations on Monday\, O
 ctober 12th from 1-4PM in the Florida Ruffin Ridley School (Café) for the
  annual Indigenous Peoples Day Celebration! This year we will be featuring
  a conversation on Whose 250? Community\, Memory and Indigenous Brookline 
 with Kailey Bennett\, IPCC Chair and Cherokee Nation Citizen. This year al
 so features a fully accessible and inclusive Fun Run (Walk and Roll!) at 1
 2:30PM before the kickoff of the event\, as well as local indigenous craft
  and good vendors\, free food\, and kids crafts and storytelling. Stay tun
 ed for more details! Sources: Meet Boston Event page: https://www.meetbost
