BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nevermore: A Cask of Curious Things An Art Show by JMAC
DTSTART:20261014T000000
DTEND:20261101T000000
DTSTAMP:20261010T163808Z
UID:c90791a0cd6a795cc1bdbd272e1050@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:From this JMAC presenter: From this JMAC presenter: ON DISPLAY
 : OCTOBER 14TH - NOVEMBER 1ST Inspired by the surrealist imagination of Ed
 gar Allan Poe\, Nevermore: A Cask of Curious Things invited artists to con
 tribute to an exhibition of strange treasures\, relics\, and collected won
 ders. Presented in collaboration with The Hanover Theatre Repertory's thea
 trical performances of monologues drawn from Poe’s writings\, this exhib
 ition explores the gothic allure of objects that carry stories: forgotten 
 trinkets\, fragments of memory\, peculiar keepsakes\, and artifacts that s
 eem to hum with mystery. Like the careful hoards made by ravens and other 
 corvids\, creatures known to gather curious and glittering things\, this e
 xhibition imagines a shadowed trove of collected relics\, each with its ow
 n quiet obsession. We sought artworks that evoke the feeling of opening a 
 hidden cask filled with enigmatic objects. Pieces may reflect themes of ob
 session\, memory\, loss\, devotion\, decay\, and the strange beauty of thi
 ngs kept and treasured. Artists are encouraged to interpret the gothic atm
 osphere of Poe’s world through objects that feel discovered\, collected
 \, or preserved. Sources: Discover Central Massachusetts Event page: https
 ://www.discovercentralma.org/event/nevermore%3a-a-cask-of-curious-things-a
 n-art-show-by-jmac/30982/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborou
 gh\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachusetts-events.ics\nSo
 urce page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/nevermore%3a-a-cask-of-
 curious-things-an-art-show-by-jmac/30982/
LOCATION:Jean McDonough Arts Center\, 20 Franklin St.\, Worcester\, MA\, 0
 1608
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/nevermore%3a-a-cask-of-curious
 -things-an-art-show-by-jmac/30982/
END:VEVENT
