DTEND:20261014T000000
DTSTAMP:20261010T163808Z
UID:db9a31a574eaae9992dfcaf7b1195b@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Join us at ValleyCAST every month for a fun\, FREE\, and creat
 ive art workshop! Starting out with a biodegradable material – a recycle
 d paper bag – we explore mark making\, drawing\, and gluing / decoupage 
 all while creating the cover to a nature journal. We will learn to make a 
 simple binding stitch and to tie the paper filler to the cover. Once finis
 hed\, we take a look outside to notice the many things living in nature ar
 ound the Whitin Mill. This is an exercise for all ages and abilities\, mea
 nt to encourage interest and wonder in one’s surroundings. This workshop
  is led by multimedia artist Charlotte Eckler\, who has learned from exper
 t artists but maintains an intuitive process that can be practiced by arti
 sts of all levels and abilities. Two Sessions Available! Morning: 10:00-11
 :00 am Afternoon: 1:00-2:00 pm Sources: Discover Central Massachusetts Eve
 nt page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/valleycast-art-cart-works
 hop-nature-journals/30886/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of Northboro
 ugh\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachusetts-events.ics\nS
 ource page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/valleycast-art-cart-wo
 rkshop-nature-journals/30886/
