SUMMARY:2026 Haunted Woods Hayride: Forest of Fear!
DTSTART:20261016T000000
DTEND:20261017T000000
DTSTAMP:20261010T163808Z
UID:027d2d78d2eac797ca9d9e743c63a9@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Experience the Terror of Horror Movies at Haunted Woods Hayrid
 e! Remember It's only a Movie.... until it's not Get ready for the most ho
 rrifying adventure of the year! Step into a world where your worst horror 
 movie nightmares come alive and the monsters of your dreams await you. Joi
 n us for a bone-chilling journey through the Haunted Woods at the Grafton 
 Lions Club. Prepare yourself for a heart-pounding hayride on wagons pulled
  by antique tractors\, as we unveil the “The Forest of Fear” So\, grab
  your friends\, hold onto your courage\, and join us for an unforgettable 
 journey through the Haunted Woods. Tickets are selling fast\, so secure yo
 ur spot now and face your fears like never before! Immerse yourself in the
  spine-tingling atmosphere as you venture deep into "The Forest of Fear". 
 Darkness surrounds you\, the "Sounds of Horror" fills your ears and with e
 ach turn of the wagon\, anticipation builds. Will you have the courage to 
 confront the creatures that lurk within? Face your fears head-on and see i
 f you can make it out alive! Our dedicated team of volunteer scare experts
  have crafted a one-of-a-kind haunted experience that will leave you tremb
 ling. Feel the adrenaline rush through your veins as you encounter mesmeri
 zing monsters\, haunted spirits\, and the unknown lurking in the shadows. 
 Be prepared for heart-stopping surprises and mind-bending thrills at every
  corner. Don't miss out on this hair-raising adventure! Haunted Woods Hayr
 ide is the ultimate destination for those seeking an adrenaline-fueled exc
 ursion. Whether you're a horror enthusiast or simply looking for a thrilli
 ng night out\, our event promises to deliver non-stop excitement and terro
 r. So\, grab your friends\, hold onto your courage\, and join us for an un
 forgettable journey through the horror movies of the Haunted Woods. but do
 n't get Lost in a Movie or you'll never make it out! Tickets are selling f
 ast\, so secure your spot now and face your fears like never before! Get y
 our tickets to Haunted Woods Hayride today! ______________________________
 ___________________________________________________________________ Group 
 Discount for purchase of 20 tickets - $2.00 off per ticket - use promo cod
 e group20 at checkout ____________________________________________________
 _____________________________________________ RESTRICTIONS NO ALCOHOLIC BE
 VERAGES ALLOWED NO TRAVEL MUGS OR CUPS ALLOWED NO BACKPACKS OR BAGS ALLOWE
 D Sources: Discover Central Massachusetts Event page: https://www.discover
 centralma.org/event/2026-haunted-woods-hayride%3a-forest-of-fear!/30778/\n
 \nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: L
 ocal fallback from massachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.disc
 overcentralma.org/event/2026-haunted-woods-hayride%3a-forest-of-fear!/3077
 8/
