SUMMARY:Family Fused Halloween Monsters
DTSTART:20261016T000000
DTEND:20261016T000000
DTSTAMP:20261010T163808Z
UID:8ba1b9995c0a3022fbb1858bdf55ab@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Want to dive into the world of fused glass at Halloween? Come 
 join us to create your own fused glass monsters! This class will give you 
 a crash course in how to shape glass and fuse it in a kiln. You’ll learn
  about the tools\, basic glass cutting techniques\, and kiln forming conce
 pts. All materials are included. No experience is necessary. Please wear c
 losed-toe shoes. The registration fee is for one adult and one child. You 
 may opt to add one additional family member (adult or child) during regist
