BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:From Clarity to Color
DTSTART:20261016T000000
DTEND:20261016T000000
DTSTAMP:20261010T163808Z
UID:1cb1c3f8356049859fb91e205e9e53@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Join pianist Dr. Yingqi Wang for From Clarity to Color: Piano 
 Voices Across Time and Culture\, a free solo piano recital presented by Do
 lce Piano & Music LLC. Friday\, October 16\, 2026\, 7:00–8:00 PM at Falc
 etti Performance Hall\, 2284 Washington Street\, Newton\, MA 02462. Free a
 dmission\; RSVP recommended. The program moves from the clarity and elegan
 ce of Mozart to the imagination of Schumann\, the lyricism of Tchaikovsky
 \, and the atmosphere and color of Debussy. The Chinese works pair Pi-Huan
 g by Zhang Zhao\, inspired by Peking opera\, with Mo Li Hua (Jasmine Flowe
 r)\, a traditional Jiangsu folk song. Dr. Yingqi Wang is a pianist whose p
 erformances bring Western classical repertoire into dialogue with Chinese 
 musical traditions. As a soloist and collaborative pianist\, she has appea
 red at venues including Weill Recital Hall at Carnegie Hall and The DiMenn
 a Center for Classical Music. Her artistic research explores Chinese folk 
 traditions and Western compositional techniques\, with a particular focus 
 on the piano music of Jianzhong Wang. She holds a Doctor of Musical Arts i
 n Piano Performance from the University of Nebraska–Lincoln. LEARN MORE 
 / GET TICKETS Sources: Meet Boston Event page: https://www.meetboston.com/
 event/from-clarity-to-color/93608/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of N
 orthborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachusetts-event
 s.ics\nSource page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/from-clarity-to-color
 /93608/
LOCATION:Falcetti Performance Hall\, Falcetti Performance Hall 2284 Washin
 gton Street\, Newton\, MA\, 02462
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/from-clarity-to-color/93608/
END:VEVENT
