DESCRIPTION:17 Years of Captivating Audiences with the Magic of Fleetwood 
 Mac The five founding members of Tusk share a bond that goes back more tha
 n four decades. Some met playing Little League baseball\, others marched t
 ogether in their middle school band and all have crossed paths in various 
 musical projects like original bands\, jam bands\, singer songwriter circl
 es and alternative rock groups. Time\, trust and genuine friendship have s
 haped a unique\, almost telepathic connection that brings their performanc
 es to life. Every note\, every beat\, every subtle shift on stage is a tes
 tament to a relationship built over a lifetime\, one that even the audienc
 e can feel. Tusk isn’t just a band\, they’re a family. Experience the 
 magic for yourself. Sources: Discover Central Massachusetts Event page: ht
