UID:83f3755898585a8f6156a1af1697b5@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Falmouth in the Fall is a classic local road race held each au
 tumn since 1979. Under the direction of Falmouth Road Race\, Inc.\, the se
 ven-mile race runs on the same seaside course as the ASICS Falmouth Road R
 ace\, offering cooler temperatures\, fewer people and a locally sponsored 
 finish festival featuring local partners. It was founded by long-time Falm
 outh Road Race volunteers Jim & Betty Gehris and Jack Oser. Pending town a
 pproval\, the race will be held on November 1st at 11:00AM. Follow FRR on 
 FB and Instagram @falmouthroadrace www.falmouthinthefall.com Sources: Cape
  Cod Chamber Event page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/annual-shipw
 recked-falmouth-in-the-fall/51872/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of N
 orthborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachusetts-event
 s.ics\nSource page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/annual-shipwrecke
 d-falmouth-in-the-fall/51872/
LOCATION:Falmouth Road Race\, Inc.\, 205 Worcester Court Unit B4\, Falmout
 h\, MA\, 02540
URL:https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/annual-shipwrecked-falmouth-in-th
 e-fall/51872/
END:VEVENT
